www-servers/angie:angie_modules_http_geo - Add support for creating variables whose values depend on the client IP-address
www-servers/angie:angie_modules_http_geoip - Add support for creating variables whose values depend on the client IP-address, using the precompiled MaxMind databases
www-servers/angie:angie_modules_http_grpc - Add support for passing requests to a gRPC server
