www-servers/angie:angie_modules_http_gzip - Add support for compressing responses using the "gzip" method
www-servers/angie:angie_modules_http_gzip_static - Add support for sending precompressed files with the ".gz" filename extension instead of regular files
www-servers/angie:angie_modules_http_image_filter - Add support for transforming images in JPEG, GIF, PNG, and WebP formats
